							<orm:DerivationNote id="_71B3D15D-E0A4-41A3-AB4C-3AAF66DCF1B3">
								<orm:Body>For each Employee and City, that Employee works in that City if and only if that Employee works for some Branch that is located in that City.</orm:Body>
